</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bf38ab10-7557-11f1-8fb2-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B3C393L.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bf38ab10-7557-11f1-8fb2-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B3C393L.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">95284640-924a-11f1-bbad-41bd60add3e8</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 18:17:08 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bf38ab10-7557-11f1-8fb2-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/000-B3C393L.jpg">AFP - JOSPIN MWISHA</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>Revamp of French parliament building faces criticism over cost and heritage</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260807-revamp-of-french-parliament-building-faces-criticism-over-cost-and-heritage</link><description>
Plans to modernise visitor facilities at the French National Assembly have become a battleground, with opponents questioning both the €53 million price tag and the proposed design.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f90dfe96-925b-11f1-a1f7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/France-National-Assembly.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f90dfe96-925b-11f1-a1f7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/France-National-Assembly.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">56effad0-9259-11f1-93b6-a9a9022b58cb</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 14:51:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f90dfe96-925b-11f1-a1f7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/France-National-Assembly.jpg">© PHILIPPE TURPIN / PHOTONONSTOP / AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>'People at war have come to help': Ukrainian firefighters battle French wildfire</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260807-people-at-war-have-come-to-help-ukrainian-firefighters-battle-french-wildfire</link><description>
A team of 70 firefighters from Ukraine is on deployment in southwest France, where wildfires have scorched 42,000 hectares in the worst blaze in decades. RFI met the Ukrainian rescuers helping to put out the last of the flames.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e305f8ce-904e-11f1-9907-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/IMG-2027.jpeg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e305f8ce-904e-11f1-9907-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/IMG-2027.jpeg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">dcd68664-919b-11f1-820b-7f942ad1b252</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 06:09:48 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e305f8ce-904e-11f1-9907-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/IMG-2027.jpeg">© Pierre Olivier / RFI</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>Africa</category><title>Ex-Benin president Talon makes political comeback via newly founded Senate</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/africa/20260807-ex-benin-president-talon-makes-political-comeback-via-newly-founded-senate</link><description>
Benin’s newly created Senate elected former president Patrice Talon as its leader on Thursday in Porto-Novo, less than three months after he left office. He will serve a five-year term at the head of the country’s new second chamber of Parliament.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/0d1ec63e-9213-11f1-8b41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-30T193143Z-1836495194-RC2BOMAX7QRY-RTRMADP-3-BENIN-POLITICS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/0d1ec63e-9213-11f1-8b41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-30T193143Z-1836495194-RC2BOMAX7QRY-RTRMADP-3-BENIN-POLITICS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">896400f2-9235-11f1-8846-ada1b72c7d88</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:47:02 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/0d1ec63e-9213-11f1-8b41-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-30T193143Z-1836495194-RC2BOMAX7QRY-RTRMADP-3-BENIN-POLITICS.jpg">REUTERS - Charles Placide Tossou</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>Sports</category><title>WAFCON: Ghana set up last eight clash with Fazili's Malawian debutants</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/sports/20260807-wafcon-ghana-set-up-last-eight-clash-with-fazili-s-malawian-debutants</link><description>
Ghana will take on tournament newcomers Malawi on Sunday for a place in the semi-finals at the 2026 women's Africa Cup of Nations (WAFCON) after a 1-1 draw with Mali.
